From 6dd95175da7eb394414cc662881986458c3905bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abinash <abinash.haldorai@eka.care>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:54:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WhatsApp: show horizontal cards as an interactive media
 carousel

When the agent asks for a horizontal card layout (`_meta.orientation`) and every
card has an image, send the cards as Meta's interactive media carousel on
providers that can (interakt_tp). Each card's button is a quick reply whose id is
the list row id, so a tap resolves through the existing list path.

Anything else stays as before: vertical layout, a card without an https image,
fewer than 2 or more than 10 cards, or a provider without carousel support send
the list; a 4xx from WhatsApp falls back to the list, a 5xx is raised.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
